    "ContentDesc_Tanzender Wahn": "You find the wandering minstrel ruminating on the curious tale of a phantasmal harlequin. A vile and terrible fiend by any measure, yet the entertainer believes the two of them share at least one artistic quality─a flair for creative flourishes. With every telling of their stories, every rendition of their songs, there is new meaning to be found. Thus are no two performances ever the same. The minstrel's melody soon transports you to a battlefield in your mind's eye, but what creative liberties will you contribute to his masterpiece?",
    "ContentName_Sigmascape V4.0": "Sigmascape V4.0",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45501_Text": "Quick, now! Make your peace with death!Because I'm making your death with all these pieces!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45502_Text": "Did you think you'd won?Oh no no no, we've only just begun!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45503_Text": "Still alive? Unbelieeevable!I really must insist you die!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45505_Text": "Yes... I am filled with glorious purpose!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45507_Text": "Such things as those...are mine to destroy!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45508_Text": "I'm afraid that's all I have time for today. Bye-bye now!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45509_Text": "Destroy! Destroy! Destroy! ...I will destroy it all!!!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45510_Text": "Hahaha! Hook, line, and stinker!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45511_Text": "What!? There's no way that didn't work!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45512_Text": "How boring. Guess I'll have to spice things up!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45513_Text": "Intriguing. This clearly isn't your first time...",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45514_Text": "This is meant to be our ultimate encounter...",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45515_Text": "Crafty little bastards, aren't you?",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45520_Text": "Right! Let's see if I can't take the reins for a spell...",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45521_Text": "Hahaha! There's nothing I can't do!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45522_Text": "Oh! What other toys can I throw in here...",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45523_Text": "Ohohohoho! What a marvelous sensation!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45524_Text": "Jealous? Enthralled? I don't blame you!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45525_Text": "Careful now!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45526_Text": "I've got big ambitions and a big attitude...",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45527_Text": "And now a big body to match─behold!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45528_Text": "Take this! And that! And one of these!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45547_Text": "Here I go!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_45548_Text": "Congratulations...you lose! Try something else next time and maybe we'll have some real fun!",
